cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "plantfolio-common-plants: a multilingual plant-care dataset"
abstract: >-
  952 houseplants and garden plants with seasonal watering intervals, light, humidity and
  temperature preferences, toxicity (ASPCA-aligned), soil pH, drainage, growth rate, propagation
  methods, USDA hardiness zones, and accepted scientific names (POWO/Kew), with descriptions and
  care tips in English, Spanish, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese. Built-in plant
  library of the Plantfolio app.
authors:
  - name: "Luminoid"
    website: "https://luminoid.dev"
version: 1.9.0
date-released: 2026-04-09
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Luminoid/plantfolio-common-plants"
url: "https://plantfolio.luminoid.dev"
keywords:
  - plants
  - houseplants
  - plant care
  - gardening
  - botany
  - toxicity
  - hardiness zones
  - dataset
  - multilingual
